**Uniform shape after remediation.** Every one of the 15 L2 daemons now has, in `core/capreg.oo`: the canonical
`std/core/ooda.oo` 4-phase turn (`oo<prefix>_ooda_turn`), the fail-closed `<prefix>_reg64_pack` / `_check` / `_attenuate`
wrappers, and the canonical `std/sec/quorum.oo` badge helper; `hw/attest.oo` and `hw/delegate.oo` route through the wrappers;
`std/sec/pqc.oo` is imported in 5–11 pages per daemon; and `grep -rn 1000000007 --include='*.oo'` returns nothing.
`core/capreg.oo` sits at exactly eight functions in every daemon — the bound, not over it.

